{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51852","headline":"题灵鹫 · 无名氏","name":"题灵鹫","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"灵鹫名山万古名，几回无事绕廊行。\n殿前流水晴尤急，塔上春云晚自生。\n鹤傍经牀听梵语，鸟窥斋鉢候钟声。\n我来借得蒲团坐，归去闲眠梦亦清。\n（《咸淳临安志》八○《寺观》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51852.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51852","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}